New 2-Bedroom Apartment in Barcelos Comfort, Modernity, and a Prime Location

We are pleased to present this magnificent new home, located in a quiet residential area with easy access, just a few minutes from downtown Barcelos.

Designed to provide maximum comfort and functionality, this home stands out for the quality of its materials, energy efficiency, and modern finishes, carefully selected to meet the demands of contemporary living. The construction features high-performance thermal insulation, aluminum window frames with thermal breaks and double-pane glass, as well as a properly insulated roof, ensuring excellent energy performance.

On the exterior, the home features elegant, contemporary architecture, complemented by ETICS (insulated exterior wall system) facades, electric blinds, interior and exterior LED lighting, and an automated gate.

The interior spaces were designed to offer comfort and well-being, with floating floors in the social and private areas, suspended wooden staircases, suspended ceilings with acoustic and thermal insulation, and high-quality woodwork in oak or beech.

The kitchen, with its modern and functional design, can be customized to the future owners taste, creating a harmonious environment tailored to the familys needs. The bathrooms also feature contemporary finishes and offer the option to choose materials and fixtures within the budget outlined in the project.

In terms of amenities, the home features solar panels for water heating, pre-wiring for air conditioning, central vacuum, and an alarm system, as well as fiber-optic internet ready for todays technological needs.

This is an excellent opportunity for those seeking a new home with high-quality finishes, excellent energy efficiency, and a strategic location that allows you to enjoy the tranquility of the countryside without sacrificing proximity to the city.

Live with more space, more comfort, and a higher quality of life, just minutes from Barcelos.

Schedule your visit today and come discover your future home.

Key Features and Finishes:

* High-quality construction with a reinforced concrete structure;

* Flat roof with thermal insulation and waterproofing;

* Facades with exterior insulation using the ETICS system (insulated exterior wall system);

* Thermal and acoustic insulation between rooms;

* Drop ceilings with crown molding for curtains and recessed LED lighting;

* CORTIZO aluminum window frames with thermal break;

* Double-pane windows with Guardian Sun exterior solar protection or equivalent;

* High-resistance vinyl flooring;

* White-lacquered woodwork, including doors, built-in wardrobes, and baseboards;

* Fully furnished kitchen equipped with BOSCH appliances:

 * Induction cooktop;

 * Range hood;

 * Oven;

 * Fridge-freezer;

 * Microwave;

 * Dishwasher;

 * Washer/dryer;

* Bathrooms equipped with extra-flat shower pan, glass shower enclosure, wall-mounted vanity, and built-in faucets;

* Air conditioning installed;

* Heat pump for domestic hot water;

* Controlled Mechanical Ventilation (CMV) system;

* Hikvision digital video intercom or equivalent;

* Garage with automatic sectional door;

* Elevator.

